==============================================================================
FFmpeg (GNU General Public License v3 or later) — bundled media tools
==============================================================================

Project: FFmpeg — https://ffmpeg.org/
License: the bundled builds include GPL components (x264 and others) and are
distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.
Builds:  macOS (arm64, x86_64): static builds by Martin Riedl,
         https://ffmpeg.martin-riedl.de/ — release 9.0.1
         Windows (x64): "essentials" builds by Gyan Doshi,
         https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/ — release 8.1.2
Pinned:  apps/desk/src/diony_desk/ffmpeg_lock.json (URL and SHA-256 per file)

Diony ships `ffmpeg` and `ffprobe` as separate, unmodified executables beside
the application and invokes them as external programs; when a build lacks
them the desk downloads the same pinned files on first open. The FFmpeg
source corresponding to each build is available from the build sites above
and from https://ffmpeg.org/download.html. The GPL covers those executables
only and does not change Diony's proprietary software license.

==============================================================================
faster-whisper / CTranslate2 (MIT License) — optional Blueprint 24 lane
==============================================================================

Project: faster-whisper (SYSTRAN) and CTranslate2 (OpenNMT)
Source: https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper
        https://github.com/OpenNMT/CTranslate2
Weights: https://huggingface.co/Systran/faster-whisper-large-v3
License: MIT License (code); the converted Whisper large-v3 weights follow
OpenAI Whisper's MIT License (https://github.com/openai/whisper).

Used only when the weights are staged on the site (`DIONY_WHISPER_MODEL`) to
transcribe, locally, the speech a provider delivered so the authored line can be
measured against it. Never contacted over the network by Production.

