==============================================================================
OpenCV Zoo — YuNet face detector and SFace face recogniser (Apache License 2.0)
— optional Blueprint 24 lane
==============================================================================

Project: OpenCV Zoo (https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo)
Models: face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx (YuNet, Shiqi Yu et al.)
        face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx (SFace, Yaoyao Zhong et al.)
License: Apache License 2.0 (models and demo code), run through OpenCV's
cv2.FaceDetectorYN / cv2.FaceRecognizerSF (OpenCV, Apache License 2.0).

Used only when both models are staged on the site (`DIONY_FACE_ID_DETECTOR_MODEL`,
`DIONY_FACE_ID_RECOGNIZER_MODEL`) to measure, locally, whether the face a
negative animates is the face in its conditioning still. Never contacted
over the network by Production.

